OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse claim at former children's
OL,4,Ahome investigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into historic sexual
OL,7,Fabuse at a former children's home has
OL,8,Fbeen launched by police.
OL,10,FA man has reported physical and sexual
OL,11,Fabuse by male staff members at Forhill
OL,12,FHouse, on Lea End Lane, Alvechurch,
OL,13,FWorcestershire, when he was a teenage
OL,14,Fboy.
OL,16,FThe offences allegedly took place
OL,17,Fbetween 1970 and 1985, West Mercia
OL,18,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
